			<Text>As George Washington, access a new Modern Dedication:[n]
				+15% Food, -10% Gold</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ATTRIBUTENODE_WASHINGTON_L1_NAME">
			<Text>Diplomatic Attribute Node</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ATTRIBUTENODE_WASHINGTON_L1_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>+25% Relationship from starting or supporting Endeavors. -25% Relationship from starting Sanctions or rejecting Endeavors.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ATTRIBUTENODE_WASHINGTON_L2_NAME">
			<Text>Expansionist Attribute Node</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ATTRIBUTENODE_WASHINGTON_L2_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>+50% Gold towards converting a Town to a City.</Text>
		</Row>
